sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Gateway as vllm-orchestrator-gateway<br/>Port 8090
    participant Config as GatewayConfig<br/>config.yaml
    participant Orchestrator as Guardrails Orchestrator<br/>/api/v2/chat/completions-detection
    participant vLLM as vLLM Inference<br/>Endpoint

    Note over Gateway,Config: Startup: Load YAML config (GATEWAY_CONFIG env)
    Config-->>Gateway: Routes + Detector definitions

    Client->>Gateway: POST /{route_name}/v1/chat/completions<br/>Authorization: Bearer Token<br/>Content-Type: application/json

    Gateway->>Gateway: Route lookup by path prefix
    Gateway->>Gateway: Resolve detector_params for route
    Gateway->>Gateway: Inject input/output detector<br/>maps into payload

    alt mTLS enabled (/etc/tls/private/ mounted)
        Gateway->>Orchestrator: HTTPS POST /api/v2/chat/completions-detection<br/>mTLS (OpenSSL)<br/>CA: /etc/tls/ca/service-ca.crt<br/>Headers: Authorization, x-forwarded-*
    else No TLS certs
        Gateway->>Orchestrator: HTTP POST /api/v2/chat/completions-detection<br/>Headers: Authorization, x-forwarded-*
    end

    Orchestrator->>vLLM: Forward inference request
    vLLM-->>Orchestrator: Inference result

    Orchestrator-->>Gateway: Response (with optional detections)

    Gateway->>Gateway: Check for detections in response

    alt Detections found AND fallback_message configured
        Gateway->>Gateway: Replace content with fallback_message
    end

    alt stream=true in request
        Gateway-->>Client: SSE stream (text/event-stream)<br/>with KeepAlive
    else stream=false
        Gateway-->>Client: JSON response<br/>application/json
    end
